Conjecture 617 is formalized and builds successfully. The statement captures:

- **`EdgeColoring (r ^ 2 + 1) r`** — an r-colouring of the edges of K_{r²+1}
- **`S.card = r + 1`** — a subset of r+1 vertices
- **`colorsUsed c S ≠ Finset.univ`** — some colour is missing from the induced K_{r+1}
